OL,3,GNEWSARobber filmed theft from man in
OL,4,Asex worker flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenaged robber who filmed himself
OL,7,Fstealing thousands of pounds from a man
OL,8,Fhe lured to a property with a promise
OL,9,Fof sex with an escort has been jailed
OL,10,Ffor three years and three months.
OL,12,FAli Abodabos, then 19, was armed with a
OL,13,Fmachete when he and a man in a
OL,14,Fbalaclava attacked their victim in a
OL,15,FNewcastle flat used by sex workers in
OL,16,FNovember 2024, the city's crown court
OL,17,Fheard.
OL,19,FThe victim, who was forced to hand over
OL,20,Fhis phone and transfer #5,250, said the
OL,21,Fordeal had been "life-changing".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
