OL,5,
OL,6,FAbodabos, now 21, admitted robbery and
OL,7,Fattempting to pervert the court of
OL,8,Fjustice, by trying to get his brother
OL,9,Fto fabricate witness statements and
OL,10,Fmake the victim withdraw his account to
OL,11,Fpolice.
